### Health
# @name health
GET {{base_url}}/health

### Health
# @name health-2
GET https://shop.example.test/health
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ping
# @name ping
GET {{base_url}}/ping?at={{$timestamp}}&id={{$guid}}
X-Request-Id: {{$guid}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Legacy token
# @name legacy-token
# Authorization from the Postman bearer auth is not added: the request sets its own
GET {{base_url}}/legacy
Authorization: Bearer {{shop_api_token}}

### 123
# @name request-123
GET {{base_url}}/numbers/123
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Properties
# Not imported: method PROPFIND is not supported
## # @name properties
## PROPFIND {{base_url}}/files/
## Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
## Content-Type: text/plain
##
## @prefix ex: <http://example.test/ns#> .
## <propfind/>

### Release notes
# Not imported: a line of the body starts with ###, which would end the request
## # @name release-notes
## POST {{base_url}}/notes
## Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
## Content-Type: text/plain
##
## Release 1.2
## ### Fixed
## - the cart

### Partner
# @name partner
# Postman oauth2 auth is not imported: add the header it sends
GET {{base_url}}/partner

### Sign up
# @name sign-up
POST {{base_url}}/signup
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "login": "ada",
  "password": "{{shop_api_password-2}}",
  "client_secret": "{{shop_api_client_secret}}",
  "page": {{page_size}},
  "profile": {"api_key": "{{shop_api_api_key}}", "tokens": ["{{shop_api_tokens}}"], "token": "{{token}}", "note": "{not json}"},
  "remember": true
}

### Status
# @name status
GET http://shop.example.test:8080/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

